    "body": "Wouldn't the following description suffice?\r\n\r\n> If the element has no label attribute and is not a descendant of a datalist element: Zero or more div, phrasing content, but with no datalist, object, interactive content, elements with the tabindex attribute descendants.\r\n\r\nThere's no need to create category(such as \"option element inner content elements\", \"excluded from option element content elements\") only for the option element.\r\n",
